---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BRAND_NAME, TOOL_NAME } from '../site';
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${BRAND_NAME}`}
  description={`How ${BRAND_NAME} handles your images and what information the site collects.`}
  robots="noindex"
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">
      Last updated: October 2026
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Your images</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
      {TOOL_NAME} processes images in your browser, on your own device. Your photos and signatures are not uploaded to our servers or to any third party. When you close or refresh the page, the images are gone.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
      We do not ask you to create an account or provide personal details. Our website host may automatically record technical information such as IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to keep the site secure and running.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
      [Currently this site does not use cookies or analytics.] If we add analytics or advertising in the future, the providers may use cookies, and we will update this page before doing so.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Links to other sites</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
      Some pages may link to other websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="font-medium text-slate-900 underline underline-offset-4">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for how we may earn from such links.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
      We may update this page from time to time. The date above shows the latest version.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
      Questions about this policy: patraritabrata6@gmail.com.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
